## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW
Culture, music, and sports represent high-engagement digital verticals that require clean user experience, real-time media/content delivery, and low-latency interaction.

Because proprietary platforms in this space range from curated cultural media feeds to talent marketplaces, ticketed live events, and fan engagement hubs, this proposal establishes our core engineering frameworks, modular building blocks, and baseline pricing tiers to define your exact scope.

