## 3. RECOMMENDED TECHNICAL STACK
* **Mobile Applications:** **React Native (Expo)** - Single performant codebase deployed natively to both **Android** (`.apk`/`.aab`) and **iOS** (`.ipa`), avoiding the high cost of separate native builds.
* **Web Admin Portal:** **Next.js (React)** with Tailwind CSS for desktop administrative control.
* **Backend API & Workflows:** **Node.js (NestJS)** hosted on high-availability cloud infrastructure.
* **Database & Media Storage:** **PostgreSQL** for user and transaction data; **Cloudflare R2 / AWS S3** for fast, cost-effective media storage and CDN delivery.

